Package: c2sr
Type: Package
Title: Convert Between C89 and Shalimar in RStudio
Version: 0.2.0
Author: G. R. Akhtar
Maintainer: G. R. Akhtar <akhtar170313@gmail.com>
Description: The Converter-C2S library as an RStudio addin. Converts the
    active editor document between C89 and Shalimar, in either direction,
    opening the result in a new editor tab and reporting diagnostics in the
    console. Constructs with no translation are carried into the output as
    comment breaks tagged BEYOND SHALIMAR; preprocessor constructs that need
    a decision are listed so each can be resolved by hand first. The engine
    is ISO C++14 and does no console work of its own.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests: rstudioapi
SystemRequirements: C++14
NeedsCompilation: yes
